TI  - Meta-Analysis: The Efficacy of Strategies To Prevent Organ Disease by Cytomegalovirus in Solid Organ Transplant Recipients
AU  - André C. Kalil
AU  - Josh Levitsky
AU  - Elizabeth Lyden
AU  - Julie A. Stoner
AU  - Alison G. Freifeld
JO  - Annals of Internal Medicine
PY  - 2005
