TI  - Kidney transplantation without calcineurin inhibitor drugs: a prospective, randomized trial of sirolimus versus cyclosporine1
AU  - Stuart M. Flechner
AU  - David A. Goldfarb
AU  - Charles S. Modlin
AU  - Jingyuan Feng
AU  - Venkatesh Krishnamurthi
AU  - Barbara Mastroianni
